Inspect effective policy, provenance, epoch and public root

Usage: cs harvest-authority status [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <PATH>        Path to the state directory (default: the galaxy's .cosmon/state/)
      --molecule <MOLECULE>  Check an installed grant against this molecule's current facts
  -v, --verbose              Enable verbose output
      --json                 Output in JSON format
  -h, --help                 Print help
